    {
      "index": 4,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_80.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_80.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "欢迎大家在留言区留言。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_32.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_32.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "这也正是为什么有一些小厂酒呢，呃就经常有一些团购的客户去选择去跟他们合作就这样一个点他有信息的不透明啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_39.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_39.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "它其实都是要有一个就相当于要有厂方啊一个培育的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_43.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_43.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "因为广西传统的是酿米香型酒的，然后米香型酒本身也做不了什么很高档的一个酒啊，是这样一个状态。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_17.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_17.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "嗯作为如果代理来说的话呢现在你要去找二线的酱酒品牌啊这个比较难，这个就相当于你要有绝对的实力。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_70.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_70.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "但是大多数的渠道酒商面对的就是老百姓及这种呃中高档的客户也是这种本身品鉴能力有限的欣赏能力有限的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_50.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_50.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "是这样一个点。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_42.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_42.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "然后其实那个你像四川的郎酒啊还有好几个酱酒在广西的这个市场呢也是斩获的比较深。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_20.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_20.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "那么作为代理来说的话呢呃您在选择上面一方面就是要首先要考察的是自己。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_73.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_73.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "所以在这个点上面不一定是说啊我们圈层或者是品酒师认为品质好的酒它就一定好卖，不是这个样子，他没有品牌，他没有影响力他照样难得动销啊是这样一个点。"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_49.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_49.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "劲酒也在做他的酱酒在安徽这边高炉啊也在弄他的酱酒，然后在江苏这边洋河之今世缘都有他们的酱酒产品。"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_16.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_16.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "他们更多的呢就是通过这个酒厂，然后还有资本来推动它的一个价格体系。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_69.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_69.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "圈层因为我们讲的这个酒瓶呢也是偏深一点啊，有点晦涩一般的老百姓可能难以理解。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_10.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_10.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "品牌的酒，一个是酱香品牌酒崛起啊那个大品牌酒就包括有浓香型等其他的香型的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_1.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_1.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "我是阿乌，很高兴在视频当中与大家见面。"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_47.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_47.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "而这几个市场的这个酱酒呢，它更多的就是当地的酒企去跟茅台镇啊或者是跟一些酒企合作然后做酱酒。"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_14.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_14.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "啊还在涨价，然后呢还供不应求。"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_67.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_67.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "感兴趣想要代理酱酒的一些朋友啊特别是搞一些团购商啊就是小规模团购啊一年搞个三五十件的这些朋友呢啊这一点一定要呃要知道这个事儿啊不是说一个酒品质好性价比高你就能够带得动因为品质好性价比高是要能够欣赏它的人识别出来才能够接受的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_3.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_3.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "最近啊有一些朋友啊，私信咨询我关于这个白酒这个代理的一个事儿啊就是代理一些酱酒啊卖什么酒比较有潜力啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_55.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_55.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "那么这里就有一个什么风险呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_51.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_51.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "那么对于一个你就像你比方说我们去合作一个二线或者是三线品牌，但是你服务的这个市场又不是这个二线品牌主打的一个区域的时候，那你去深耕这个市场是比较累的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_45.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_45.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "酒企实力都比较的弱啊所以他对这个本土的市场的把控是有限的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_9.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_9.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "当前呢如果从大环境上面来看确实是品牌酒崛起及酱香型品牌酒，一个是大。"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_61.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_61.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "可以考虑一下本土的一个酱酒。"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_19.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_19.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "一定的实力四线呢，可能门槛就稍微低一点啊那如果是小品牌酱酒呢那个门槛就更低。"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_72.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_72.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "有的时候一些商呃一些宴请就是大家都认什么品牌我们选什么品牌，就是这样一个情况。"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_37.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_37.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "你像在呃不管是在酱香型酒还是在别的香型酒里面啊除了那些高档名酒啊，那种高档名酒走高档圈层以外，你只要是走到你。"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_28.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_28.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "因为他是很高粘度的客户，然后他卖这种酒，卖这种高返利高不透明的酒，那如果要是卖这个品牌嫡系酒的话，第一，他对你的这个酒厂啊，品牌对你的这个销售。"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_4.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_4.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "嗯没想到我一个搞这个品酒的一个主播呢，结果被被别人带到就去咨询这方面的内容啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_56.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_56.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "就是大家一定要注意的就是我们。"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_6.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_6.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "也是整理了一下啊也是结合我们原来碰到的一些人事儿啊酒圈里面的一些事儿呢，也是给大家提一些信息啊，提供一些信息给一些参考啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_48.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_48.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "你像现在啊湖北白云边也在做他的酱酒那个。"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_35.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_35.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "那你就千万就不要选择什么返点比较高的啊这种小厂酒了，那你就要选择大厂。"
