      "index": 42,
      "filename": "20260127_00004328_awpj_23_12.wav",
      "src": "https://mmilabel-1258344707.cos.ap-guangzhou.myqcloud.com/upload/unpack/hiccupli/20260401/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_spk0/20260127_00004328_awpj_23_12.wav",
      "selectedIndexes": [
        0,
        1,
        1,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "text": "然后呢这个呃当前的这个酱香酒啊比较的火啊所以很多人关注过来。"
